========================================================================================================================
HPE VM ESSENTIALS (VME) 8.1.2 - ADVANCED TROUBLESHOOTING COMMANDS
========================================================================================================================

CATEGORY               COMMAND                                         DESCRIPTION
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Virtualization & Dom   sudo virsh list --all                           List all local virtual machines and states
Virtualization & Dom   sudo virsh dominfo <domain>                     Show detailed configuration & resource info for VM
Virtualization & Dom   sudo virsh domstate <domain>                    Check current operational state of specific VM
Virtualization & Dom   sudo virsh start <domain>                       Power on a stopped virtual machine
Virtualization & Dom   sudo virsh shutdown <domain>                    Gracefully shut down a virtual machine
Virtualization & Dom   sudo virsh destroy <domain>                     Forcefully power off a hung virtual machine
Virtualization & Dom   sudo virsh console <domain>                     Open direct serial text console to a guest VM
Virtualization & Dom   sudo virsh dumpxml <domain> > vm.xml            Export VM configuration to an XML file backup
Virtualization & Dom   ps aux | grep -i qemu                           Identify running QEMU processes and PID details
Virtualization & Dom   sudo virsh domblklist <domain>                  List all virtual disks attached to the VM

Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl status                        Check status of all VME appliance microservices
Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl stop                         Stop all core management application services
Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl start                        Start all core management application services
Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl restart                       Full restart of all VME management services
Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl restart morpheus-ui           Restart only the web user interface service
Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure                  Reapply settings and rebuild configuration files
Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl tail                          Tail live logs for all appliance services
Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui              Stream live web UI startup and error logs
Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl tail elasticsearch            Monitor search database health and index sync logs
Service Control        sudo morpheus-ctl tail mysql                    View real-time management database logs

Network & Netplan      ip a                                            Display all network interfaces and assigned IPs
Network & Netplan      ip route                                        Show the active kernel routing table
Network & Netplan      sudo netplan try                                Test a new netplan config with auto-rollback
Network & Netplan      sudo netplan apply                              Commit and apply network configurations instantly
Network & Netplan      cat /etc/netplan/*.yaml                         View current system network configuration files
Network & Netplan      sudo virsh net-list --all                       List all hypervisor-managed virtual networks
Network & Netplan      sudo virsh net-info <network>                   Show properties of a specific virtual network
Network & Netplan      sudo virsh net-dhcp-leases <network>            List active DHCP IP assignments for guest VMs
Network & Netplan      bridge link show                                Display network bridge configurations and ports
Network & Netplan      sudo tcpdump -i <interface> icmp                Capture live ping traffic to debug interface drops
